<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<body class="portal-legal-body">
  <header class="portal-legal-header">
    <a href="/login" class="portal-legal-brand" aria-label="Findoly provider login">
      <img src="/images/findoly-logo.png" alt="Findoly">
      <span>Provider portal</span>
    </a>
    <a class="btn btn-light btn-sm" href="/login">Provider login</a>
  </header>

  <main id="policy-top" class="portal-legal-shell">
    <article class="card portal-legal-card">
      <div class="card-body">
        <span class="portal-legal-kicker">Findoly Solutions LLP</span>
        <h1>Contact Us</h1>
        <p class="portal-legal-lead">Official email and business-address details for Provider Portal support, payments, privacy and policy questions.</p>
        <p class="portal-legal-effective">Effective and last updated: 30 July 2026</p>
        
        <nav class="portal-legal-toc" aria-label="Contents of Contact Us">
          <strong>On this page</strong>
          <ol>
          <li><a href="#email">Email support</a></li>
          <li><a href="#address">Business address</a></li>
          <li><a href="#subjects">Suggested email subjects</a></li>
          <li><a href="#details">Information that helps us respond</a></li>
          <li><a href="#policies">Policies and escalation</a></li>
          </ol>
        </nav>
        <div class="portal-legal-content">
<section id="email">
  <h2>1. Email support</h2>
  <p>For Provider Portal access, payment, credits, lead records, privacy, policies or complaints, email <a class="portal-legal-email" href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>"><%= supportEmail %></a>. Findoly does not publish a support telephone number for this Portal.</p>
<p>Use the email address associated with your Provider account where possible. Include the registered mobile number and a clear subject so the case can be routed correctly.</p>
  <a class="portal-legal-back-link" href="#policy-top">Back to contents</a>
</section><section id="address">
  <h2>2. Business address</h2>
  <p><strong>Findoly Solutions LLP</strong><br>WeWork Mindspace, 6th Floor,<br>Malad West, Mumbai – 400064,<br>Maharashtra, India.</p>
<p>This is a business contact address. The Provider Portal supplies digital services and has no physical-return or parcel-delivery facility.</p>
  <a class="portal-legal-back-link" href="#policy-top">Back to contents</a>
</section><section id="subjects">
  <h2>3. Suggested email subjects</h2>
  <ul><li>Login Support</li><li>Payment Review</li><li>Credit or Subscription Issue</li><li>Lead Data Concern</li><li>Privacy Request</li><li>Intellectual Property Complaint</li><li>Formal Grievance</li></ul>
  <a class="portal-legal-back-link" href="#policy-top">Back to contents</a>
</section><section id="details">
  <h2>4. Information that helps us respond</h2>
  <p>Include relevant dates, order or payment references, lead references, screenshots and a short description of the expected result. Remove OTPs, UPI PINs, CVV and full card numbers. Do not send unnecessary customer personal data.</p>
  <a class="portal-legal-back-link" href="#policy-top">Back to contents</a>
</section><section id="policies">
  <h2>5. Policies and escalation</h2>
  <p>Review the policy relevant to your issue before writing. Formal complaints and escalation are handled under the <a href="/grievance-redressal-policy">Grievance Redressal Policy</a>.</p>
  <a class="portal-legal-back-link" href="#policy-top">Back to contents</a>
</section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>

    <section class="portal-legal-navigation" aria-label="Policies and support">
      <strong>Policies and support</strong>
      <%- include('../partials/policy-links', { policyLinksClass: 'portal-policy-links' }) %>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="portal-legal-page-footer">
    <span>© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> <%= legalEntityName %></span>
    <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>"><%= supportEmail %></a>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
